SUMMARY:How Higher Dimensional Consciousness Solves All Your Old Problems
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nYou’ve heard the
  Einstein inspired quote (he didn’t exactly say it) that “we cannot so
 lve a problem from the level of consciousness that created it.” It’s t
 rue and at the heart of the ascension process in which you become the crea
 tor in the creation. The creation is already in the creator\, since consci
 ousness starts everything. Your higher self sees all from above time and s
 pace. Thus your own higher dimensional self-love has already planned a fab
 ulous life for you. Wouldn’t you help yourself\, if you knew how to? Of 
 course you would! So 3d living (three spatial dimensions\, aka 3rd density
 ) is not where you want to be inventing new plans that create new problems
 . Join us Sunday June 14\, 2026 for a free mind-expanding heart-opening ta
 lk on why your 3d freewill really just means learning to follow and enjoy 
 your own predestined happy ever after life.\n\nFeeling rebellious? Don’t
  worry\, you still have a kind of freewill\, even if everything is already
  scripted. We always have the option to filter and block well-made plans a
 s much as we like. This is what is meant by the idea that “everyone’s 
 a sinner”. Not that we’re bad\, but from our limited human understandi
 ng we can either follow guidance or mess things up. Every mistake will bec
 ome a life lesson\, so your plan is continually adjusted for you to stay o
 n track. But you can get stuck and delay conscious learning\, which many p
 eople do to create problems that must be solved eventually.\n\nIt’s like
  a fabulous vacation itinerary. Every morning you wake up and face options
  for how much to enjoy the daily plan. You can try choices to learn what p
 leases you most\, such as what to eat\, who to talk to\, and what details 
 to focus on. Heck you can even get paranoid over who’s controlling your 
 life (you) and run in the opposite direction to hide from your own friends
 . It’s what many people do\, although it is not recommended.\n\nIt’s n
 ot a good idea to entertain fearful ideas about your own higher self\, bec
 ause then you’ll disconnect and still need someone to guide you. It just
  won’t be the divine You. The opposite of your loving creator self is th
 e negative ego or devil self. Yes\, we all have a trouble-making side whic
 h can be deadly dangerous. Some psychologists say there are no bad parts\,
  but there are and you can handle them. Learn to validate yourself in the 
 face of invalidations that start with inner critics and then by law of att
 raction become outer enemies. When your reality becomes a place of culture
  wars and conflicting tribes then you’ll know it’s time to get back to
  your higher self.\n\nOh\, that’s happening today! Yep\, better get back
  to following our own higher self for safety\, health\, and happy prosperi
 ty.\n\nYour higher self has the best positive way for you to understand an
 d use everything in your life. It’s your guide\, mentor\, best friend an
 d protector. And what’s really cool is that you’re becoming it\, via y
 our future self. Your future self is the you who has solved your current p
 roblems and knows exactly what you need to do to live the best. Let your f
 uture self take care of you\, along with your whole soul family. They are 
 all the parts of your greater consciousness which includes all that you wi
 ll ever know.\n\nSo you literally live within your own higher self\, aka h
 igher mind or super-consciousness. When you decide from higher levels to i
 ncarnate in a world\, you get a copy of the entire Universe from that self
 ’s perspective. Of course\, because every consciousness has its own expe
 rience that cannot be denied. Thus consciousness is the ultimate dimension
 .\n\nFor this meetup\, imagine what your life would be like with a complet
 e soul family of fun\, friendly\, super interesting\, helpful and successf
 ul versions of yourself to share the journey and trade solutions. Physical
  reality then gives more connections to other souls\, which can be great a
 nd never limiting. When human beings demand that all of their emotional ne
 eds only get met by other people\, they miss out on the world of secure et
 ernal support from inner energy. What needs have you tried to fill in phys
 ical life with incomplete success? What if your spiritual home is what you
  need to be complete? After check-ins to share and relate\, I’ll explain
  how the higher self incarnates into the unconscious\, subconscious\, and 
 conscious minds that you need to own and operate responsibly for the best 
 life you always dreamed. We’ll conclude with a guided meditation to conv
 ert past mistakes into current life lessons for permanent healing and new 
 personal transformation.\n\nWelcome! Our Inner Selves Mastery spiritual su
 pport group is free online every Sunday 11am-130pm EDT\, with the last 30 
 minutes for a guided meditation. If you can’t stay you can get the recor
 ding. You can signup here for this meeting and visit www.signupISM.com for
  all events\, newsletter\, videos\, and more.\n\nBest wishes\,\nCarl Johan
 n Schroeder\nInner Selves Mastery\nspiritual teaching and coaching\nquick-
 links at [www.signupISM.com](http://www.signupISM.com)
